OL,3,AWhy are more roofs not made of solar
OL,4,Atiles?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people in the US "still hate the
OL,7,Flook of solar", Kate Collardson
OL,8,Facknowledges.
OL,10,FShe would know. Collardson handles
OL,11,Foperations for the Solar Service of
OL,12,FColorado, a solar maintenance and
OL,13,Finspection company. She's also held
OL,14,Fjust about every other job in the
OL,15,Findustry, from installer to instructor.
OL,17,FFor those that hate the look of solar
OL,18,Fpanels, an alternative is a solar roof,
OL,19,Fwhere the tiles (or shingles) house
OL,20,Fsolar cells, but look much the same as
OL,21,Fregular tiles.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
